{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"mudbrick-classless-leonberger","creation_channel":"python","description":"## Context\nThe GitHub About description currently says Rebar is an LLM-first event-sourced ticket system and Jira reconciler, then identifies GitHub as a read-only mirror. It does not explain the capability that distinguishes Rebar from conventional trackers. ADR 0018 and the plan-review gate guidance establish enforceable review before claim. The completion gate and operation-certificate guidance establish signed verification before close.\n\n## Plan\n- Replace the `navapbc/rebar` repository description with concise client-facing wording that leads with plan review.\n- State the observable mechanisms rather than make an unsupported superiority claim.\n- Preserve the read-only GitHub mirror and Gerrit code-review facts.\n- Keep the description within GitHub limits and avoid internal implementation terms.\n- Read the repository metadata back after the update and record the exact value.\n- Change GitHub repository metadata only.\n\n## Proposed Description\nRebar can block work until an AI plan review passes, require signed completion verification before close, and reconcile its event-sourced ticket record with Jira across CLI, Python, and MCP. GitHub is a read-only mirror. Code review runs in Gerrit.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] The GitHub About description leads with enforceable plan review before work begins.\n- [x] It names signed completion verification, event-sourced history, Jira reconciliation, and the CLI, Python, and MCP interfaces.\n- [x] It preserves the read-only mirror and Gerrit review facts.\n- [x] It fits the GitHub repository-description limit.\n- [x] [non-codebase] `gh repo view navapbc/rebar --json description` returns the approved description exactly.\n  provenance: environment=GitHub repository metadata for navapbc/rebar; principal=JoeOakhartNava; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — authoritative GitHub repository metadata readback for the About description\n- [x] No repository file, homepage URL, or topic changes.","id":"6845-b94b-f718-46a3","parent_id":"e867-0f39-b887-40fa","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"task","title":"F20 update GitHub About to emphasize plan review"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788161009047829001,"uuid":"90283bbd-3f40-4aa7-82aa-28dd8f31bc02"}